Garden
This is a small garden surrounded by a high wall. It is unlike anything you 
have ever seen: a little waterfall and stream and a small bridge and manicured 
pebbled paths and rocks and flowers and shrubs. It's so clean, so neat. The 
house is to the west, the village to the east.

Sitting at the bottom of the steps are your boots.

You see the middle-aged woman here.

