Waterfront
This is the waterfront of the village. The ground is cobbled and a stone 
launching ramp goes from the shore into the sea. There are men and women 
cleaning fish. Small islands are visible to the east and south. At anchor, to 
the east, is the Erasmus.

There is a small boat here. The small boat contains oars.

It comes suddenly to mind that since you awoke, you haven't seen your rutters 
or the rest of the crew. Can they still be on the Erasmus, you wonder?

