Prison:
Cell Block
Score:200
Moves:226
Toranaga's guards take you to the prison, strip you, and force you through the 
door of one of the cell blocks.

At dawn it is feeding time and the guards pass out cups of gruel and water 
through a small opening. The lining up for food and water is unusually calm -- 
without discipline no one would eat. You take your ration and pick your way 
over the bodies toward a corner.

Cell Block
This murky and suffocating room is fifty paces long and ten wide and packed 
with naked, sweating Japanese. Scarcely any light filters through the boards 
and beams that make up the walls and low ceiling. A heavy iron door seals the 
prisoners in.

An apelike man stares at you with hatred.

227
>examine apelike man
You see nothing special about the apelike man.

Suddenly, the apelike man -- unshaven, filthy, lice-ridden -- chops you over 
the kidneys and takes your ration. The others wait to see what will happen.

228
>attack man
You feign momentary helplessness, then kick him viciously.

The prisoner tries to bite you.

The other prisoners watch impassively.

229
>attack man
You butt your head into the man's face.

The thug kicks out, trying to trip you.

The other prisoners watch impassively.

230
>attack man
You close with him, intending to attack him, but he grabs you. You manage to 
