Time passes...

"'Nihon go ga hanase-masen' is 'I don't speak Japanese,' and yes, you must 
apologize, so you say 'gomen nasai' as well. The daimyos are prideful and as 
touchy as wasps, but courteous, ah, so courteous!"

244
>wait
Time passes...

"It is so good to teach, senor!" Domingo continues to teach you simple words 
and phrases. The old man is lonely, and proud of his knowledge, and his success
in converting the prisoners.

245
