groups move into skirmish positions, eyeing each other hostilely.

The man in the palanquin gets down and you recognize him. It is Kasigi Yabu! He
shouts at the bandit leader but the man shakes his sword furiously, ordering 
them out of the way. Yabu gives a curt order, and charges with a screaming 
battle cry, limping slightly. The bandit guarding you swings his sword at you!

