Escape:
Interlude

The galley escapes from Osaka harbor, the rowers speeding it back towards 
Anjiro and Toranaga's capital, Yedo, beyond.

For your services to him, Lord Toranaga gives you a rare honor. He makes you a 
hatamoto, a high rank of samurai. This is a position of a special retainer to 
his personal staff. You have his absolute protection. In return, you are 
instructed to learn Japanese, and train a regiment of troops in European 
tactics and the use of muskets.

But best of all, he says he will return the Erasmus to you, but he won't say 
when.


