You let yourself slide down, mud and stones crumbling off of the wall and 
almost blinding you. You reach the narrow ledge on which Mariko is standing.

There is a new shock. The ledge you and Mariko are on mostly gives way, only a 
few tiny holds remaining as the rest falls downward.

383
>boost Mariko
Your terror lends you inhuman strength and somehow you manage to rip Mariko out
of the tomb and shove her upward. Toranaga clutches her wrist and hauls her 
over the lip of the chasm.

The chasm howls and begins to close. The far wall screeches sickeningly as it 
approaches. Mud and stones tumble off it.

320
384
