"Ah! Possible? Possible? Anjin-san?"

"Yes," you reply, "Yes!" And you think, by next year, a new ship, a ship like 
her, trim and miniature like a Yoshitomo blade, and just as dangerous. Next 
year she'll take the Black Ship, a prize twenty times her own weight, like 
Mariko did at Osaka. "The Lady will be her name," you say aloud.

Toranaga salutes you warmly, for the first time as an equal.

